    <div style="font-size: 9pt; color: #6B5A47; margin-top: 8px;">
      <strong>Storage:</strong> Store in a cool, airtight glass container. Stays fresh for up to 30 days at room temperature.<br/>
      <strong>Allergen Notice:</strong> Contains tree nuts (almonds, cashews) and dairy (desi ghee).
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

